  1. (3) commits extortion OF (f's extortion) is “robbery” if the offender, at the time of committing the extortion, is f's in the presence of the person put in fear , and commits the extortion by putting that person in fear of f's instant death f's to that person , and, by so putting in fear, induces the person so put in fear f's then and there to deliver up the thing extorted
